    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d84">

                <pb facs="0176" n="77" xml:id="pg77"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.34119/715</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The American Delegate</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Braden</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 327</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1936-12-11"
                            >December 11, 1936</date>.<lb/>[Received December 18.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report activity in the
                    Chaco negotiations in memoranda which I have delivered to Assistant Secretary of
                    State Welles.</p>
                <p>I transmit herewith copies of my two memoranda of December 4, one of December 8,
                    three of December 10, and one of December 11, 1936.<anchor n="53"
                        xml:id="d84-f1"/></p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Spruille Braden</hi></signed></closer>






